{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "22875adb-2f9e-82ae-84b5-97c5417a4dc4",
  "created_at": "2025-12-11T12:38:06-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Zoning and Inspections",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Bridget Kearney",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Greg Lombardi",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T12:33:38-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zoning and Inspections, this is Greg."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T12:33:41-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, Greg. Yes. Um, this is Bridget Kearney. I'm calling about, uh, a license. For a rental."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T12:33:48-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. What kind of rental? Long-term lease, or short-term, like a vacation rental?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T12:33:54-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, that's the thing. [pause] It's a two-month stay. January into March, about. Someone wants the house for the winter. And I was told by, oh, I don't remember who, that I need a short-term rental license. And I thought, in winter? For two months? That seems like a lot of fuss."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T12:34:13-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, I hear that. Is it a single stay, one party for the whole two months?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T12:34:20-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "One party. One. A couple, I think. They found it online, and, um, [pause] sorry, hold on, I have my music going, let me turn that down."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T12:34:31-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T12:34:33-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "There. It's just a little speaker on the counter. It's an old habit, I have it on while I do the books. Where was I?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T12:34:43-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A couple, found it online, two months."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T12:34:46-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right. Right. So do I need the license or not? Because nobody can give me a straight answer, and I've been on the phone since the morning with one office and another."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T12:34:58-05:00",
      "duration": 24,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry about the runaround. Here's the general rule. Anything rented for a shorter period than a standard lease usually falls under the short-term rental rules, and a stay of a couple months can land in a gray area depending on how it's defined. I don't want to hand you a wrong answer on the exact cutoff, so let me check how it's classified. What's the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T12:35:22-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's 30 Old Beach Road. Down toward Easton's Beach, the side by the water. I manage it for the owner."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T12:35:30-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 30 Old Beach Road. Hang on a second, let me pull it up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T12:35:36-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. Take your time. [pause] I've got all day, apparently."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T12:35:41-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I'm back. Here's what I can tell you. A rental that short, you're better off applying for the license than guessing, because operating without one when it's required is where people get in trouble. If it turns out not to be needed, the office will tell you when you file."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T12:36:00-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So I have to fill out the whole thing anyway. Just to find out if I need it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T12:36:07-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "More or less, yes. I know that's not what you wanted to hear."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T12:36:13-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No. No, it's not. [pause] All right. What do I bring? Which, uh, which documents?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T12:36:19-05:00",
      "duration": 23,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Bring the owner's name and contact information, proof of ownership, like the deed or a tax bill, and your own ID since you're acting as manager. If you're managing for the owner, bring something in writing that says you can act for them. Also a copy of the rental agreement or listing, and anything showing smoke and carbon monoxide detectors are in place."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T12:36:42-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Wait, slow down. The deed. Or the tax bill."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T12:36:46-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, either one works as proof of ownership."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T12:36:50-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "And the, the letter from the owner. That I can act for him."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T12:36:56-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Correct. Short and signed is fine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T12:36:59-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "And the detectors. I thought somebody came out and looked at those."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T12:37:04-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "There may be an inspection as part of the process, but have your documentation ready. That way it moves faster."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T12:37:12-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hm. And, um, [pause] what was the first one again? I wrote the owner's name."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T12:37:18-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Owner's name and contact information. Then proof of ownership, your ID, the letter, the rental agreement, and the detector info."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T12:37:26-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Okay, I've got that. It's a lot for two months, Greg. I'll say that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T12:37:32-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. If you want, I can have someone call you back to confirm whether this stay even needs the license before you do the paperwork."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T12:37:42-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, please do that. That would save me a trip. It's 401-555-0171."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T12:37:47-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0171, and that's Bridget Kearney, 30 Old Beach Road. I'll put the note in today."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T12:37:53-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right. Thank you. I'll, uh, I'll wait for the call, then. Otherwise I'm just going around in circles."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T12:38:01-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. Have a good afternoon, Ms. Kearney."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T12:38:04-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Bye now."
    }
  ],
